export anchor CardCatalogueStyle:
    number: 43
    screen: ProjectDetail
    name: Card catalogue
    idea: The project is a drawer of library index cards, each one typewritten on ruled stock with a call number, a punched hole and rubber stamps for status.
    base: light
    palette:
        linen: #efe8da, the page and the punched holes
        card: #fffdf4, index cards and fields
        ink: #26221d, typed text and the primary button
        faded: #5e564b, tracings and labels
        ruledBlue: #c9daea, the ruled lines on cards, decorative only
        redLine: #d98b80, the header rule on cards, decorative only
        stampRed: #a3231a, the Blocked stamp
        stampGreen: #1f5a37, the On track stamp
        oak: #d8c3a0, the drawer front
        brass: #b08d3c, the label holder and the drawer pull
        guideBuff: #f3e7c4, guide cards with tabs and the focus halo
        pencilBlue: #1b3f73, the handwritten discussion note
    type:
        A typewriter mono, "Courier Prime", "American Typewriter", "Courier
        New", Courier, monospace, on a 24px line grid. Sizes are 22px bold
        for the drawer label, 15px bold card headings ending in a full stop,
        15px regular body, 12px bold stacked call numbers at 12px line
        height, and 13px bold uppercase tabs and stamps with wide tracking.
        The discussion note uses a hand font, "Bradley Hand", "Segoe Print",
        cursive, at 18px.
    layout:
        A cream top bar holds BRIGHTWORK in tracked caps, nav links, a Look
        up field and Reader Mara Okafor. Below sits a wide oak drawer front
        with a brass label holder showing DSN 01 and the title, the Add card
        and Edit buttons, and a brass pull. The cards follow in a grid of
        330px minimum cards, three across on wide screens. A main entry card
        carries the facts, a typed progress bar of X and dots, and an On
        track stamp. A summary card carries the brief and tracings. Buff
        guide cards with raised tabs span the full width to divide
        Milestones, Open tasks and Discussion. Each open task gets its own
        card. The files card is a See also list. The notes card holds the
        pencilled quote and a reply line. Each card has a stacked call
        number at top left, a hanging indent, a red header line, blue ruled
        lines and a punched hole at the bottom centre. Below 600px the cards
        stack in one column.
    spacing: The 24px line grid set by the ruled cards. 24 to 30px between cards and an 86px hanging indent after the call number.
    density: Medium. One fact per typed line and one task per card.
    corners: Square cards, 3px tab tops, a 4px drawer and round punched holes.
    borders: 1px warm grey card edges, a 2px oak brown drawer frame, and a double line border on the Blocked stamp.
    shadows: A 1px edge line and a soft 2px drop under cards, and an inset shadow in each punched hole.
    icons:
        Typed brackets beside words, X for done, a slash for in progress and
        a blank for planned. Rubber stamps carry a tick for On track and a
        slashed circle for Blocked, tilted a few degrees. The drawer pull
        is drawn in SVG.
    focus: A 2px ink outline offset 3px with a 5px buff halo.
    tone: Cataloguer shorthand ending in full stops, such as Assigned, Aiko Tanaka, and See also.
